//
// This script DOES:
//   1. Rebuild locked 2015 and 2010 predictor stacks
//   2. Perform within-year robust normalization
//   3. Build normalized 2015 class signatures
//   4. Screen the final 2015 training pixels against 2010
//   5. Assign:
//        STABLE
//        UNCERTAIN
//        CHANGED
//        NO_DATA
//   6. Apply 2010 clear-observation QA
//   7. Apply local spatial-consistency QA
//   8. Print class-wise automation feasibility
//
// IMPORTANT
// ---------
// The normalized images are ONLY for temporal-transfer screening.
//
// Final 2010 Gaussian MLC will later use the ORIGINAL 2010
// Landsat-5 SR + NDVI/NDWI/NDBI predictor stack.
//
// ================================================================


